{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_st01","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":1,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-ST-1","storyName":"路口的红绿灯","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"祥子从奇怪的梦中苏醒，并与红豆讨论了梦的内容。之后，祥子和红豆一起执行外勤任务，由此认识了梦城堡的爱丽丝和贝娜。祥子从爱丽丝口中得知，她们要用梦城堡的“美梦”拯救爱丽丝的笔友。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_st01","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_st01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"next":1,"characters":["祐天寺若麦","丰川祥子","若叶睦","三角初华","八幡海铃","？？？","红豆","慌张的干员","贝娜","爱丽丝","司机"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_traffic_amb","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sidewalklight_red","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":10},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"3.5","id":11},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"啊哈，今天的化装舞会也很成功！","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"你们注意到安可时大家激烈的欢呼声了吗？！有个孩子，一看就是喵姆亲的大粉丝！","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我出场的时候，她的眼睛都变得闪闪发亮了！真是让人开心啊~","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"等到下次舞会的时候，要不要再多增加些和粉丝的互动呢~","id":23},{"type":"dialog","id":24},{"type":"charslot","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","duration":"1","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"祐天寺小姐，研究如何增加魅力无所谓，但希望你不要忘记遵守Ave{@nbs}Mujica的世界观。","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"欸......祥子，这么怕我抢走观众的喜爱呀？","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我的粉丝只是沉浸在了Ave{@nbs}Mujica的化装舞会里罢了。让他们也迷上Mujica，这难道不好吗？","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"哪怕是站姿，也属于表演的一部分。直到最后一秒，我们都不能松懈。","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我们的使命就是让被邀请来的客人沉醉在这场舞会里。","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"为此，我们得将充满说服力的世界观全面地呈现给大家——","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"明白啦，明白啦。","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"不过呢~睦子登场的时候才是欢呼声最大的时候吧？","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"“真开心啊~”“希望粉丝更多些~”睦子真的不会有这样的想法吗？","id":43},{"type":"charslot","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"我......没有......","id":46},{"type":"dialog","id":47},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.7","focus":"m","isblock":"true","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"请你不要煽动睦。","id":51},{"type":"dialog","id":52},{"type":"charslot","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#13$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":54},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"哈哈......大家不要这样......","id":56},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我只是觉得大家应该都很期待下次的演出啦~","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"现在喜欢我们的人这么多，我们就应该乘胜追击，用百分之百的努力去回应他们。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"这几天阁楼上的台灯一直亮到很晚才熄......小祥正在尽最大的努力制作新曲。","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这段时间以来，Ave{@nbs}Mujica的大家都在努力付出，我怎么能懈怠呢。","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"小祥......","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"祥子可不能把自己累坏了呀！","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"我们都能感受到小祥你的心意，我也会努力创作出与新曲相配的歌词。","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"刚才演出前丰川同学给我听了样曲，是首不错的曲子。","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"我倒是觉得......节奏可以再慢一点？","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"8","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"欸？！你们都已经听过了吗？什么时候？！","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"就在刚才开演前，你好像没在休息室里？","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"本来是想收集全体成员的意见，但因为时间紧迫就先给当时在场的人听了。","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"若麦拉我去她的直播频道做客......我也没听到。","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"呃......！","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"什么？！","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"祐天寺，我不是说过不能——","id":89},{"type":"dialog","id":90},{"type":"charslot","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sidewalklight_green","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"bgs1","id":92},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs1","fadetime":"2","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"绿、绿灯要亮起来了！我们赶紧走过去再说吧！","id":96},{"type":"dialog","id":97},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"0.7","id":98},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.6","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":102},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":103},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":107},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":108},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"2","id":109},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"唉，真是头疼......","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"......真好啊。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯？为什么突然这么说？","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"听了小祥你刚才的那番话，我也深有感触。","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"经历了这么多，即使有争吵，我们五个人还能在一起组乐队......真好啊。","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"虽然没有问过，但我相信，大家一定都是这么想的......尤其是我自己。","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"大家都很感激小祥。小睦也过得很开心，海铃和若麦也说她们在Mujica实现了自己的梦。","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......梦。","id":125},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":128},{"type":"text","text":"祥子顺着初华的视线望去，几个少女正嬉闹着穿过人行道。","id":129},{"type":"text","text":"她们无忧无虑，仿佛一切都和童话一样美好。","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"至于我自己，能被小祥你这样信任，真的很开心。","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"真想把我的人生都奉献给Mujica！","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"一切都和以前一样......感觉就像做梦似的。","id":135},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸......","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......做梦？","id":139},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":142},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":143,"musicid":1},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0.7","end":"true","id":146},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"你们两个别在这吵啊......","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你是要我舍弃乐队这个定位吗？！","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$2","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我反正无所谓是不是乐队。","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸？！","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#2$2","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"说到底，有什么必须拘泥于乐队这个形式的理由吗？","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你说什么——","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#2$2","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"再说了，睦子本人又没意见，她还在电视节目里说“不可能长久”。","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我看她别说乐队这个形式，就连退出Mujica也根本不在乎吧？","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4183_mortis_1#6$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"......","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#7$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那是——","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"......我不会让Mujica解散的。","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$2","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"怎么扯到这里了？我没说要解散啊。","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"成员退出就意味着解散，这等于背叛了支持我们的来宾。","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$2","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我的意思是刚才就已经背叛了。更何况，初子嘴上说得好像很重视，其实你忙得几乎没来练习过吧？","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#12$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"......","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#4$2","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"你这样太不负责了吧？","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"怎么这样说......！","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"要说负责的话，祐天寺小姐你才该多练习吧？！","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4186_tmoris_1#9$1","afrom":"0","ato":"0.8","duration":"0","end":"true","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"我从没觉得祐天寺小姐缺乏练习过。丰川同学，是你不关注其他成员吧？","id":183},{"type":"dialog","id":184},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":186},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"在初华快步追上前方的同伴时，祥子却只是恍惚地站在人群之后。","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"她出神地看着交替闪烁的信号灯，双腿却像灌了铅一般，无法移动半步。","id":190},{"type":"dialog","id":191},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sidewalklight_green","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"bgs2","id":192},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs2","fadetime":"3","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":194},{"type":"image","image":"65_i01_1","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"喂——你还在那傻站着干嘛呀？","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"八幡海铃","text":"有什么东西忘拿了？","id":198},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":201},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“即使这样还是信不过我吗？！”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":202},{"type":"subtitle","id":203},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"......祥，绿灯要结束了。","id":206},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“祥，武道馆，没问题吗？”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":210},{"type":"subtitle","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"小祥？","id":214},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“小祥，你还是回去吧。别再见我比较好......”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":218},{"type":"subtitle","id":219},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"丢三落四的，我们可不会等你哦！","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“......恶心。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":226},{"type":"subtitle","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":229},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sidewalklight_green","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"bgs2","id":231},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs2","fadetime":"1.5","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":233},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sidewalklight_red","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"bgs3","id":234},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs3","fadetime":"2","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":236},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainlight_loop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":237},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"c","fadetime":"6","id":238},{"type":"image","image":"65_i01_2","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":240},{"type":"text","text":"提醒行人通过的提示音急促地鸣响着，祥子想要跟上大家的步伐，可信号灯已经变成了红色。","id":241},{"type":"dialog","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carhorn","volume":"1","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"text","text":"一辆辆车飞驰而过，祥子撩起被风吹乱的发梢，信号灯的光映照出她面庞的轮廓。","id":245},{"type":"text","text":"有什么落在了她的手心。","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"水......下雨了？","id":247},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"c","fadetime":"6","id":249},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_traffic_amb","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"amb","id":250},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"amb","fadetime":"6","id":251},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":252},{"type":"text","text":"雨滴从天空落下，越来越快，越来越多。","id":253},{"type":"text","text":"蓦然间，她似乎想起了许多事——","id":254},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"cg","duration":"3","from":"0","to":"1","block":"false","id":256},{"type":"text","text":"周遭的声音在耳边不断放大，人群的喧闹、汽车的鸣笛，不由分说地穿透她的耳膜。","id":257},{"type":"text","text":"雨水浸湿了她的衣衫，和泪水混杂在一起。","id":258},{"type":"text","text":"她的悲伤与无助不能告诉任何人，可她仰面失控的号哭又说明了一切。","id":259},{"type":"text","text":"刻骨铭心的怅然与失落席卷而来，她的视线也和回忆一同变得模糊不清。","id":260},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":262},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":263},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"amb","fadetime":"2","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"image","id":267},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":268},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":269},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_powerengine_run","volume":"0.6","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"哐当，哐当。","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"祥子，祥子？","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯......嗯？","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"太阳晒屁股啦，该起床咯？","id":276},{"type":"dialog","id":277},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"charslot","id":280},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_bg_bg_room_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":281},{"type":"bgeffect","id":282},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_dim_openeye","layer":"1","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":285},{"type":"bgeffect","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","duration":"2","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":289},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":290,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"红......红豆小姐？是梦吗......","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"不是梦哦。","id":294},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","random":"true","power":"5","times":"60","duration":"0.5","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"红豆，不要捏我的脸？！","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"这不是帮你确认一下嘛，而且我也没用多大力吧。","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"（掐掐自己的脸蛋）喏，还好吧？","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"一大早就被冷不防地捏脸，谁都会受不了吧？！","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"好啦好啦，不逗你了。赶紧收拾一下，我在外面等你。","id":307},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"1","channel":"step1","loop":"false","id":309},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step1","fadetime":"2","id":310},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":312},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorclosequite","volume":"1","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":314},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_powerengine_run","volume":"0.8","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":316},{"type":"text","text":"耳朵贴在微凉的墙壁上，通过舰船相连的结构，依稀能听见动力层全速运转的声音。","id":317},{"type":"text","text":"哐当，哐当。","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"原来是动力层的声音啊......","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那个奇怪的场景，还有那些人......到底是谁？","id":323},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":325},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"charslot","id":327},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_bg_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","id":330},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"你是说——你梦见了一群完全不认识的人？","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......嗯。还有梦里的那个场景，我也从来没有见过。","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"从未见过的载具，陌生的建筑，还有她们身上的装束......","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"说不定是影片里的场景？","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"我有时睡前看纪录片，也会梦到自己来到了纪录片里的地方......","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"但是之前并没有发生过类似的事情......","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"是不是最近太累啦？","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"前几天鞭刃小姐还和我说，你每天都训练到很晚，只有等到她来提醒，你才肯结束。","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"还有，在最新的工程部志愿者名单上，我好像也看到了你的名字......","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"你刚来这没多久，还有很多时间和机会去适应。","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"要是感觉累的话，不如先给自己放个假休息一下？","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"没事的，我自己简单调整一下就好了......","id":352},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":355},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的干员","text":"祥、祥子小姐！能来帮帮忙吗？","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的干员","text":"医疗部新接收了一批病人，现在急需人手帮忙安置......","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"我记得祥子本来没有负责这部分的工作吧？","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"而且让一个新人来负责这种复杂工作，对她来说，压力也太大了吧？","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_501_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的干员","text":"对、对不起，是负责人让我优先过来找祥子小姐的......","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_501_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"在哪里？我现在就和你过去。","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"欸？","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"之前我帮她们打过下手，具体的工作流程我已经很熟悉了。","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"既然是人手紧缺，那我一定会尽力协助。","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"喂......","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"红豆，我们还是老地方见吧！","id":377},{"type":"dialog","id":378},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"0.7","id":379},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":380},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"哎，哎！","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"真是的，她是什么时候学的这些啊......","id":384},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":386},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":387},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":388},{"type":"charslot","id":389},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_bg_bg_warehouse_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":391},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":392,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"五十三，五十四，五十五......五十六......","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"这边货架的物资快清点完了，等会装完箱就能出发。","id":397},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"嗯......都过了一个小时了，祥子怎么还没过来？","id":399},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"charslot","id":401},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","duration":"1","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"祥子，你终于来啦！","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"非常抱歉，患者那边多花了些时间......","id":408},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"没关系啦。嗯......不过祥子你来罗德岛才几个月，为什么我总感觉你已经来了好久了？","id":410},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸，有吗？","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"大家都已经开始习惯依靠你了，觉得各种各样的事交给你做肯定没问题。","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"就连我自己也是，经常要提醒自己，你还是个新人，不能给你太大压力。","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"我之前在音乐社团的报名表上看见了你的名字，结果社团活动你一次都没能参加......","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"红豆，没关系的。","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我加入罗德岛，就是因为想要帮助人们对抗矿石病。","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"矿石病......我记得你母亲好像就是因为矿石病去世的？","id":421},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......嗯。","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"在她去世前，我曾天真地以为，自己每天都能无忧无虑地生活。","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......但这片大地并没有那么美好。","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"看着母亲痛苦地维持生命，直到最后不治离世，再加上我来到罗德岛之后的所见所闻......","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我意识到这片大地上还有很多苦难正在发生，我要学的还有很多。","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"嗯，我也能稍微理解你的心情了......","id":430},{"type":"dialog","id":431},{"type":"charslot","id":432},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","volume":"0.6","id":433},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"红豆，你那边还没有好吗？","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"车队已经准备完毕了，就等你和那批物资了啊。","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"欸，不好！我马上处理一下！","id":438},{"type":"dialog","id":439},{"type":"charslot","id":440},{"type":"playsound","key":"$transmission","volume":"1","id":441},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这些打包好的物资，是要急着运到哪去吗？","id":444},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"附近的一个小镇急需食物和医疗物资，那里治安不算好，需要有人护送。","id":446},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我和你一起去吧，肯定有我能帮上忙的地方。","id":448},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"不行，你......","id":450},{"type":"dialog","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":452},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":453},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"好，好吧......","id":455},{"type":"dialog","id":456},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":457},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":458},{"type":"charslot","id":459},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_bg_46_g1_transporter.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":460},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_369_bena_1#1$1","id":461},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#5$1","id":462},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":463},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":464},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":465},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_369_bena_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"爱丽丝，你没必要这么紧张，更不用自责。","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"......我本应该早些发现的。","id":469},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_369_bena_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":470},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"不可能凡事都滴水不漏。更何况你们一直是通过书信交流，察觉不到很正常。","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"可是......可是她！","id":473},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_369_bena_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"你的呼吸又急促起来了......来，深呼吸，放轻松些。","id":475,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"我刚刚已经催促过红豆了，我们一会就出发。","id":476,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_338_iris_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"......一定要在天黑前赶到。","id":478},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_369_bena_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"会赶到的。","id":480,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_369_bena_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"见到她以后，一切就按我们说的去办，不会出差错的。","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":483},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":484},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":485},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"nw","id":486},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"nw","id":487},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":488},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":489},{"type":"charslot","id":490},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":491},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":492},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":493},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":494},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"抱歉！我们来迟了！","id":496},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"没事的——","id":498},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"刚好赶上——司机先生，可以出发了！","id":500,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":501},{"type":"text","text":"发动机剧烈地轰鸣起来，载具飞快地向前方的道路开去。","id":502},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"呼，希望没有耽误太久——","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"刚才实在太匆忙，都忘记给你们互相介绍一下了！","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"这位是新加入的实习干员，祥子，和你们一样，也是来自维多利亚，现在在跟着我做一些后勤的工作。","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"而这两位干员，爱丽丝和贝娜......嗯......怎么介绍呢......","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"哦！是“仙女”！","id":508},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":509},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"呃。“仙女”？","id":510},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":511},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"算了，红豆，由我们自己来介绍吧。这种情形我们遇到过很多次，轻车熟路啦。","id":512,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"祥子小姐是维多利亚人的话，应该看过不少本地童话？","id":513,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"小时候在故事书里读过一些。","id":515},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":516},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"那你相信它们是真的吗？","id":517,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":518},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯......？","id":519},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":520},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你要说信不信的话......小时候倒会一直追着妈妈问。","id":521},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":522},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"那就是现在不相信咯。","id":523,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":524},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"也不是这个意思——","id":525},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":526},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"但童话里说的都是真的哦。","id":527,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":528},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"“在维多利亚的森林里，矗立着一座梦城堡，里面住着带给孩子们美梦的仙女。”","id":529,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":530},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这种地方真的存在吗？","id":531},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":532},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"祥子，我记得你还没有成年？你那些奇怪的梦，也许和仙女有关？","id":533},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":534},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"不经过孩子的允许，擅自进入他们的梦境，对于仙女来说是不可原谅的事情。","id":535},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"梦除了是自身想法的映射，同样也是想法形成的过程。对于心思细腻的孩子来说，更是如此。","id":536},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"有些梦，甚至可以改变一个孩子的一生。","id":537},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"所以我们虽然给孩子们带去美梦，但梦的内容究竟是什么，以及具体何时带给他们，都要征得他们的同意后，再慎重考虑。","id":538},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":539},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"其实我的那些梦，也很难被称作“美梦”......给我带来的更多是困惑。","id":540},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":541},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"如果之后爱丽丝没有那么忙了，可以让她帮你解一下梦哦。","id":542,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":543},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"爱丽丝，你们应该很久没有休息过了吧？","id":544},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"你们停驻罗德岛的时间实在太少了，所以之前祥子才一直没机会认识你们。","id":545},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":546},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"爱丽丝是梦城堡的主人，很多事都需要她亲自操劳。","id":547,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":548},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"唉——可惜“造梦”这方面，我完全不行，不然就能帮爱丽丝多分担一些了。","id":549,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":550},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"（小声）虽然也有其他有造梦天赋的人......但那个“孩子”实在太危险了。","id":551,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":552},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那这次你们也是和以前一样，要给孩子们带去美梦吗？","id":553},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":554},{"type":"multiline","name":"贝娜","text":"是，也不是......","id":555},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":556},{"type":"multiline","name":"贝娜","text":"爱丽丝，可以说吗？","id":557},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":558},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"......这件事，由我自己来说吧。","id":559},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":560},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"一年前，我无意间翻到一本童话书，里面的故事深深吸引了我。","id":561},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"我顺着扉页留下的地址，和书的作者成了笔友。我们通过书信往来交流彼此对童话的见解与想象。","id":562},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"可是最近，她的回信越来越少，我也很久没有她的消息了。","id":563},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"直到两天前，我又收到了她的信，里面附上了一篇未发表的作品。","id":564},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"故事的主人公有个暴躁易怒的父亲，并且她还被所有同龄人孤立......","id":565},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"那篇作品跟她以前写的故事完全相反，而她和我说......那就是她真实的人生。","id":566},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":567},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......","id":568},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":569},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"信的最后，即将成人的她提到了自己的生日，日期是......明天。","id":570},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":571},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"天哪，竟然还没有成年......！","id":572},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":573},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"结尾的那句话，让我无论如何都无法释怀......","id":574},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"她说她不想长大......","id":575},{"type":"dialog","id":576},{"type":"charslot","id":577},{"type":"text","text":"<i>“这是我的最后一封信。”</i>","id":578},{"type":"dialog","id":579},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":580},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"......距离明天，还有不到十二个小时。","id":581},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":582},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"嗯。这就是爱丽丝如此着急的原因，我们必须尽快赶到小镇，找到——","id":583,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":584},{"type":"dialog","id":585},{"type":"charslot","id":586},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tyrexplosion","volume":"0.8","id":587},{"type":"playsound","key":"$drift","volume":"0.6","delay":"0.5","id":588},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":589},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":590},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":591},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"怎么了？！","id":592},{"type":"dialog","id":593},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":594},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":595},{"type":"charslot","id":596},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":597},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","id":598},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","id":599},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":600},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":601},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":602},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_970_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":603},{"type":"dialogue","name":"司机","text":"路况实在太差，车爆胎了......","id":604,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":605},{"type":"charslot","id":606},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_338_iris_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":607},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"......什么？！","id":608},{"type":"dialog","id":609},{"type":"charslot","id":610},{"type":"text","text":"灼阳之下，滚烫的热浪侵蚀着每个人的皮肤。","id":611},{"type":"text","text":"接下来，是漫长的等待。","id":612},{"type":"dialog","id":613},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":614},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":615},{"type":"charslot","id":616},{"type":"image","id":617}],"characters":["祐天寺若麦","丰川祥子","若叶睦","三角初华","八幡海铃","？？？","红豆","慌张的干员","贝娜","爱丽丝","司机"]}